## Restriction

You may not use the Licensed Work, or any derivative of the Licensed Work, to build, operate, or offer a Commercial Governance Service.

This restriction applies regardless of:

- architectural composition
- code modification level
- degree of integration into a larger system
- whether the governance functionality is primary or incidental

Any system that exposes governance decisions derived from the Licensed Work to third parties is prohibited without a commercial license.

